OL,3,GNEWSADad loses nan and wins #3.5m house
OL,4,Awithin 24 hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Worcestershire dad says his late
OL,7,Fgrandmother "had something to do with"
OL,8,Fhim winning a #3.5m London home and
OL,9,F#250,000 in cash less than 24 hours
OL,10,Fafter she died.
OL,12,FJamie Loveridge, 37, said his family
OL,13,Fwere still coming to terms with their
OL,14,Floss when they received the
OL,15,Flife-changing news.
OL,17,FThe father-of-two initially ignored the
OL,18,Fcall telling him he had won and blocked
OL,19,Fthe number before his wife answered.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
