OL,3,GNEWSADad loses nan and wins #3.5m house
OL,4,Awithin 24 hours
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We lost my nan the night before we
OL,7,Ffound out we'd won the house, so that
OL,8,Fwas all we were thinking about," he
OL,9,Fsaid.
